<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP eyes Indonesia nickel study finish.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP eyes Indonesia nickel study finish.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Friday that it expected to complete a mine feasibility study by the end of next year on a nickel deposit on Gag Island in Indonesia with P.T. Aneka Tambang.</p>
<p>BHP said last year it would hold a 75 percent stake in the venture if a mine was developed.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
